e": "Blade Runner: Reslashed", "keywords": ["Sword", "Yippee", "Blade", "Runner"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Blade Runner: Reslashed!\n\nThe world's dominant species are cute lil' creatures named Yippees. You follow John Slayer, an Olbi cashier working a 9-5. One bad day at work is all it takes for him to finally snap. Brawl with your sharp sword, hard-hitting cricket bat and trusty lever-action rifle in a stylish, fast-paced combat system that could easily make a devil cry.\n\n# Features\n- STUPID enemies!! they're weak yet overwhelming in large numbers, making crowd control vital to survival\n- AWESOME weapons!! each weapon serves a unique purpose, encouraging frequent switching throughout combat\n- INTENSE movement!! move with your hands and take fights to the sky with air combos and parkour\n- STYLE!! get rewarded for stylish kills, diverse weapon usage and moving fast in an addictive style ranking system\n\n# You brought this upon yourself, John\n... so slash 'em, bash 'em and make 'em POP to prove that the name \"Slayer\" wasn't just a coincidence.", "short_description": "One bad day at work is all it takes for John Slayer, an Olbi cashier working a 9-5, to finally snap. Brawl with your sharp sword, hard-hitting cricket bat and trusty lever-action rifle in a stylish combat system built around diverse weapons, intense movement and enemies in overwhelming numbers."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/blade-runner-website/home/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Olbi Interactive", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/WBBmjzfd6m", "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/blade-runner-website/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {